    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bfd8fd71-b503-532a-9f39-2e7fbd243354" activityNameId="ee62033a-f5df-5af2-85f8-06fa6a31b919" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, maintenance, airport</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, maintenance, airport
The data represents the airport in Zurich (uniqueairport). All data presented refers to one year.\n\n\n;
UUID: d568708a-6fc3-32b8-94cc-1d3923d1da0a
The inventory includes energy expenditures and airport energy infrastructure. Transport services on airport site are included.  The use and emissions of de-icing materials are taken into account. Also land transformation and occupation are accounted for.
Location: Data refers the conditions at the major airport in Switzerland.
Technology: Data represents current technologies
Time period: The use of de-icing materials is calculated as the geometric mean of 3 years.
Production volume: na
Sampling: environmental report and oral communication. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: Data from one airport in Switzerland is used as an estimate for Europe
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d568708a-6fc3-32b8-94cc-1d3923d1da0a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
        <comment>
